{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:2ec16f29b7cc3e41","name":"Insect Swarm","source":{"id":"source:reference-2ec16f29b7cc3e41","title":"Insect Swarm","revision":26542,"timestamp":"2025-03-26T06:28:53Z","sha256":"7ac719bcd174177aba1226b215d5d436fd262711ebcd800912ceeee70e43dfaa","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=26542","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Insect%20Swarm&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-2ec16f29b7cc3e41","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Unknown Regions Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Unknown_Regions_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["A dark cloud rapidly approaches, along with a low buzzing sound that gradually increases in volume."]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Tiny insects are common in swamps. On their own, they are merely a nuisance, but in large groups they become more dangerous. Insect Swarms can be a diversion, good for distracting pursuers while giving the pursued time to regroup. Swarms can also ruin the aim of combatants, drawing their attention away from intended targets as they brush the bugs aside.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Insect Swarm Statistics (CL 3)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Keywords:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Atmosphere"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Atmosphere"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Natural"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Natural"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Trigger:"]}," A being begins its turn within an Insect Swarm.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Attack:"]}," +5 vs ",{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Damage:"]}," 2d10 (Half Damage on Miss)\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Recurrence:"]}," Each round at the start of the target's turn, as long as the target remains within the Insect Swarm.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"},":"]}," The following are suggested ",{"tag":"a","children":["Skills"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Skills","referenceId":"reference:66d0f523a379b2de"}," for this Hazard:\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"ul","children":[{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Knowledge (Life Sciences)"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knowledge_(Life_Sciences)"}," (DC 14):"]}," The character identifies the Insect Swarm."]},"\n",{"tag":"li","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Survival"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Survival","referenceId":"reference:8302496de0ace160"}," (DC 19):"]}," The character realizes that entering a body of water or a sealed environment is the best way to avoid the Insect Swarm."]}]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
